   "text": "UserRegistered: identity → notification\nCampaignPublished: campaign → contribution, search, update, notification\nCampaignRejected: campaign → notification\nContributionRegistered: contribution → campaign, search, notification\nGoalReached: campaign → search, notification\nCampaignUpdated: update → notification\nCampaignClosed: campaign → contribution, search, update",
